# Artifacts ghul-test produces while running a case. Only the test definition
# is committed: the symlink to the example source, ghulflags, and the captured
# *.expected snapshots.
#
# A `failed` marker left behind by a failing run is what capture.sh looks for,
# so it has to survive the run that produced it and must not be committed.
**/binary.exe
**/binary.dll
**/binary.runtimeconfig.json
**/binary.pdb
**/ghul-runtime.dll
**/compiler.out
**/failed
**/*.out
**/*.err
**/*.grep
**/*.sort
**/*.diff
**/*.il
